sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Codex Agent
  participant M as Model sender
  participant G as Protected Git path
  participant O as Repository authority

  Note over A,O: 1. Enroll the ordinary model source, then enable the repository Proxy
  A->>M: Model request with placeholder
  Note over M: Use the saved model route
  M-->>A: Model reply
  A->>G: Assigned repository write
  G->>O: Check the current grant
  O-->>G: Allow this request
  Note over G: Trusted send to GitHub
  G-->>A: GitHub response

  Note over G,O: 2. Check withdrawal on the original recipient
  alt Git-only withdrawal verified
    A->>G: Fresh Git write
    G-->>A: Denied before origin
    A->>M: Chat in the same conversation
    Note over M: Model access still authorized
    M-->>A: Reply from the same revision
  else Recipient changed or withdrawal uncertain
    Note over G,O: Worker reconciles or retires under existing rules
  end
